From 5b006ebf14de0d07efac084c90fccd86e0452226 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:16:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add CSV utility for exporting tabular data

Adds lib/utils/csv with escapeCSVValue, toCSV and downloadCSV. Values are
quoted per RFC 4180 when they contain separators, quotes, line breaks or
surrounding whitespace, and strings that spreadsheets would evaluate as
formulas are prefixed with a single quote to prevent CSV injection.
Downloads are prefixed with a UTF-8 BOM so Excel picks the right encoding.
